  "description": "Introducing Wedding Holiday – an enchanting font designed for those special moments. The charm of this script font lies in its delicacy, whispering stories of love and celebration in every gentle stroke. It’s perfect for wedding invitations, save the date cards, and other heartfelt communication, promising to add a touch of refinement and elegance to every encounter. With its soft appearance and stunning style, Wedding Holiday is the script font you’ve been dreaming of to express love in its most beautiful form.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Wedding Holiday – an enchanting font designed for those special moments. The charm of this script font lies in its delicacy, whispering stories of love and celebration in every gentle stroke. It’s perfect for wedding invitations, save the date cards, and other heartfelt communication, promising to add a touch of refinement and elegance to every encounter. With its soft appearance and stunning style, Wedding Holiday is the script font you’ve been dreaming of to express love in its most beautiful form.</p>",
